{"base":{"webm":"/voice/eat-a-lot-base-73def43231b5.webm","m4a":"/voice/eat-a-lot-base-73def43231b5.m4a","lines":{"me|Dinner's ready!":[0,1067],"sam|Something smells amazing!":[1217,2258],"sam|Wow, you made all this?":[3625,1777],"me|Eat a lot!":[5553,1156],"sam|A lot? Uh… how much?":[6859,3064],"me|Enjoy your meal!":[10072,1236],"sam|Thanks, waiter! Ha!":[11458,2197],"me|Help yourself!":[13805,1067],"sam|Don't mind if I do!":[15022,1305],"me|Eat deliciously!":[16477,1276],"sam|Deliciously? How do I do that?":[17903,2781],"me|Don't be shy, dig in!":[20834,1998]}},"followUp":{"webm":"/voice/eat-a-lot-followUp-bfc6f1c953cc.webm","m4a":"/voice/eat-a-lot-followUp-bfc6f1c953cc.m4a","lines":{"sam|Okay… one more bite.":[0,2714],"sam|No. I'm done. Really.":[2864,3592],"sam|That was so good. I'm stuffed.":[6606,3006],"me|Dessert goes in another stomach!":[9762,2013],"sam|Dessert stomach? Ha. Okay, one slice.":[11924,4054],"me|Are you sure you're really full?":[16129,1890],"sam|Yes, I'm sure…":[18169,1880],"me|There's always room for dessert!":[20198,1997],"sam|Okay, fair. Just one slice!":[22345,3308],"me|You must eat cake!":[25803,1708],"sam|Must? Is that a rule?":[27661,2487],"me|Come on, just one bite!":[30298,2011],"sam|One bite… okay, fine!":[32459,3322]}}}